7.1 Entry Set vs Wait Set

| Feature      | Entry Set         | Wait Set                                     |
| ------------ | ----------------- | -------------------------------------------- |
| Waiting For  | Monitor           | `notify()` / `notifyAll()` (or interruption) |
| Cause        | `synchronized`    | `wait()`                                     |
| Thread State | Usually `BLOCKED` | `WAITING` or `TIMED_WAITING`                 |
| Owns Lock    | ❌ No              | ❌ No                                         |

7.2 Monitor vs Lock

| Monitor                         | Lock                                     |
| ------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |
| JVM intrinsic mechanism         | General synchronization concept          |
| Used by `synchronized`          | Can refer to intrinsic or explicit locks |
| Automatically acquired/released | Explicit locks require manual management |
